      bullCase: "The rapid response by Binance to cover losses and rebuild systems, coupled with Polymarket\'s commitment to refunds, demonstrates a maturing industry\'s dedication to user protection. The ability of the wider crypto community to freeze significant portions of stolen funds also signals improved collaborative defense mechanisms, which could lead to greater long-term trust and institutional adoption.",
