      neutralCase: "While significant, these hacks represent isolated incidents within a vast and continuously evolving digital asset landscape. The industry\'s reactive measures, such as enhanced security protocols and user compensation, are crucial learning experiences. The long-term impact will depend on the effectiveness of these countermeasures and the industry\'s ability to proactively address emerging threats, balancing innovation with robust security.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Cautious Recovery\' outlook is most probable (60%). The immediate negative sentiment from such large-scale hacks is undeniable. However, the industry\'s commitment to user compensation and enhanced security measures will likely mitigate the worst long-term impacts. There\'s a 30% chance of \'Prolonged Skepticism\' if further major breaches occur or regulatory crackdowns are severe, and a 10% chance of \'Rapid Resilience\' if security innovations quickly outpace threats.",
