      bearCase: "The reported 30 BTC loss in Q3 highlights the significant risk. If Bitcoin\'s volatility leads to further declines, H100 could face substantial capital erosion, making buybacks less efficient and potentially damaging investor confidence. This strategy could be seen as reckless, exposing the company to unnecessary market fluctuations.",
