      bearCase: "The sheer scale of the Binance hack, combined with the attribution to state-sponsored actors, highlights a fundamental and escalating security vulnerability in the crypto ecosystem. Repeated breaches, despite assurances, will erode investor confidence, deter new entrants, and likely invite heavy-handed regulation that could stifle innovation and growth.",
