      neutralCase: "The Binance hack, while significant, represents a mixed bag of outcomes. Binance\'s ability to cover losses and freeze some funds shows a degree of resilience, but the scale of the theft and the involvement of sophisticated state actors underscore ongoing vulnerabilities. The incident will likely drive necessary security enhancements and regulatory evolution without fundamentally altering the long-term growth trajectory of the crypto market.",
