      keyRisks: ["Further escalation of drone attacks or regional conflicts impacting oil supply.", "US Congress failing to address critical fiscal issues, leading to government shutdowns or debt ceiling crises.", "Recessionary fears in major global economies, dampening demand.", "Unexpectedly high inflation requiring more aggressive central bank tightening."],
