    investorTakeaways: ["**Prioritize Direct Purchases:** Always buy hardware wallets directly from the official manufacturer\'s website to minimize supply chain risks.", "**Inspect for Tampering:** Thoroughly examine new devices for any physical signs of compromise, such as opened packaging, unusual components, or scratches.", "**Verify Authenticity:** Utilize official tools and guidance provided by manufacturers (like Ledger) to verify the authenticity and integrity of your device before setup.", "**Never Share Your Seed Phrase:** Your seed phrase is your ultimate key; never input it anywhere online or share it with anyone, regardless of claims.", "**Stay Informed:** Keep abreast of security advisories and best practices from reputable crypto security sources to adapt to evolving threats."],
