    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a Ledger hardware wallet prominently in the foreground. The wallet appears partially transparent or x-rayed, revealing a subtle, glowing, nefarious microchip or circuit board hidden within its casing. In the background, blurred digital code or a network diagram suggests data exfiltration. The overall tone is serious, conveying a sense of hidden threat and compromised security, with subtle hints of financial loss, like faint dollar signs or crypto symbols in the digital background. Use a dark, professional color palette with hints of red or orange for danger. The composition should be dynamic, suitable for a financial news report, focusing on the hardware and the invisible threat. Avoid any specific branding beyond the general shape of a hardware wallet to maintain conceptual focus.",
