      bearCase: "The estimated $6.3 billion Binance hack profoundly erodes investor confidence, particularly among new entrants and institutions, who may view crypto as too risky due to the lack of mandated protections like FDIC insurance. This could lead to sustained capital outflows, increased regulatory crackdowns stifling innovation, and a prolonged period of market stagnation or decline as trust rebuilds.",
