      tokenOverview: "This article primarily focuses on Bitcoin (BTC) as the benchmark cryptocurrency impacted by the alleged breach, and Binance (BNB) as the native token of the affected exchange. Bitcoin, the original decentralized digital currency, serves as a store of value and medium of exchange. BNB is used for trading fee discounts, participation in token sales on Binance Launchpad, and powering the BNB Chain ecosystem.",
